description	"Sub Zero

^2Weaponry:
- Frost Sword
-- ^5Cyan ^7/ ^4Blue ^7Styles
-- Melee / Ranged Defense (1)
-- Ranged Deflect (2)
- Frost [Ice Thrower] ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Ice Shield [Cortosis 1, Melee Resistance]
- Regeneration [Health and Shields]

Sub Zero left the Lin Kuei clan of ninja to join the rebellion against Shao Kahn. In doing so, he came to Earthrealm to form his own clan, so that they may be ready to fight alongside him against Shao Kahn and his forces."